00:16:55.600 --> 00:16:56.920
Anda dapat menjalankan ekstraksi

00:16:56.920 --> 00:16:58.280
harian otomatis interaksi copilot,

00:16:58.480 --> 00:16:59.520
mengirimnya ke penyimpanan blog,

